{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19700","headline":"送段九秀才归沣州 · 吕温","name":"送段九秀才归沣州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"湘南孤白芷，幽托在清浔。\n岂有馨香发，空劳知处深。\n摧贤路已隔，赈乏力不任。\n慙我一言分，贞君千里心。\n寸义薄联组，片诚敌兼金。\n方期践冰雪，无使弱思侵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕温","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19700.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19700","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}